{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["חכלילי — reddish eyes are so called." "ולבן שנים — from drinking milk, as written: שתיתי ייני עם חלבי. And likewise: בלא כסף ובלא מחיר יין וחלב." "ולבן — like לבן. When it is in construct state it is pronounced וּלְבֶן. As in: מן חלב וחלב צאן."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:42.579712272Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}